    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say that but it doesnt feel like just a \"difficult time\". it feels like i am being dragged into the dirt. the shame is so heavy. every person i know is going to see me at my absolute worst, begging for help or losing everything. there's no dignity in that. it's just... it's a slow, humiliating crawl to the bottom. i feel like i'm losing control of how people see me and how i see myself.",
