      "content": "but how can it have meaning? my whole life was built on being someone capable, someone who could provide. now i'm just a burden and a cautionary tale. if you were in my shoes, seeing the absolute wreckage of your reputation and everything you worked for, wouldn't you feel like the only way to actually keep some shred of yourself together is to stop the descent before you hit the absolute bottom? i just hate the idea of being pitied.",
